    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d259">

                <pb facs="0499" n="485" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg485"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 European War 1939/2088</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>], <date calendar="gregorian" when="1943-12-27">December 27,
                            1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The British Ambassador<anchor n="11" xml:id="d259-f1"/> called at his request and
                    handed me an <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> in regard to a peace
                    feeler by the Germans, a copy of which is hereto attached. I thanked him. He
                    said that of course he did not know what was in it, but that it was the most
                    serious proposal from Germany his Government has thus far received.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d259-a1.xml" xpointer="d259-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d259-f1" n="11" xml:id="d259-f1-content">
                <p>Viscount Halifax.</p>
            </note>
